title: "M0: deterministic state semantics, a Lean-mechanized model"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Topicspot"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Topicspot/m0-semantics"
license: "MIT OR Apache-2.0"
version: "1.1"
date-released: "2026-07-29"
keywords:
  - observational determinism
  - refinement
  - Lean 4
  - mechanized semantics
  - substrate independence
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 mechanization of M0, a deterministic state semantics built around
  observational determinism. Proves a ladder of results (L1-L5): sequential
  determinism, parallel-to-sequential refinement, the boundary of safe
  observations, strictness of the equivalence levels, substrate independence
  over two interface laws, and failure-tolerant substrate independence under
  crash-stop failures. Includes an independent differential witness and a
  reproducibility manifest.
